{"title":"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A group of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> people consists of men, women and children (at least one of each). Exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/3/8f37626d49b4082c9102bf930bca51277ff2eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> apples are distributed in such a way that each man gets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> apples, each woman gets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> apples and each child gets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> apple. In how many possible ways can this be done? \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/b/0bb731ace7c23af039d71f77d13daa31a405da66.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[m + w + c = 100\\]\" width=\"132\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/2/7f263eba3ffd56eb68e285ecdcf72cc3e257d079.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[6m + 4w + c = 200\\]\" width=\"150\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Subtracting the second equation from the first, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/1/011bd6da7af4fe59c8949d0a7d3222a4bd657722.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5a + 3b = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"108\" height=\"14\" />. Looking at this equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/0/0d0a15aaabd8cac9d17c8302503a5471eaf91f02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mod{5}$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/f/d6f55180c90b5e279d1cea00eee6163532dee3e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3b$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> must be a multiple of 5, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/8/07837ccef21a6fd1357a2a456211d7a098f639c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5|b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" />. Thus the choices for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/4/f84b09d7ac816a301919a6e78fedd1f6e468d284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5,10,15,20,25,30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"139\" height=\"16\" />, which gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> possible choices.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC\" title=\"2005 PMWC\">2005 PMWC </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I5\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I5\">Problem I5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I7\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I7\">Problem I7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">I: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I1\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I2\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I3\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I4\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I5\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I7\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I8\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I9\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/in